#T> Hello World
#D> Opens Notepad and types a greeting
#R> Windows computer with Notepad

LED_ON
DELAY 1000
GUI r
DELAY 500
STRING notepad
ENTER
DELAY 1000
STRING Hello from PiPo Ducky!
ENTER
STRING This script was written using the PiPo scripting language.
ENTER
ENTER
STRING You can customize this to say whatever you want!
ENTER
LED_OFF
